#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:5
#: 5391ff97ef4b4248917ab8ab9a7713f1
msgid "Gremsy Mio, Pixy, S1, T3, T7, and ZIO 3-Axis Gimbals"
msgstr "Gremsy Mio、Pixy、S1、T3、T7 和 ZIO 三轴云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:7
#: 1b59aff163984117b7db04e1b2a47f43
msgid ""
"Gremsy `Mio <https://gremsy.com/products/mio>`__, `Pixy F "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/pixy-f>`__, `Pixy U "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/pixy-u>`__, `Pixy WP "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/pixy-wp>`__,  `S1 "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/gremsy-s1v3>`__, `T3 "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/gremsy-t3v3>`__, `T7 "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/gremsy-t7>`__ and `ZIO "
"<https://gremsy.com/zio>`__ 3-axis gimbals can communicate with the "
"autopilot using the MAVLink protocol and are compatible with a range of "
"cameras for real-time video or mapping purposes."
msgstr ""
"Gremsy `Mio <https://gremsy.com/products/mio>`__、`Pixy F "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/pixy-f>`__、`Pixy U "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/pixy-u>`__、`Pixy WP "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/pixy-wp>`__、`S1 "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/gremsy-s1v3>`__、`T3 "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/gremsy-t3v3>`__、`T7 "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/gremsy-t7>`__ 和 `ZIO "
"<https://gremsy.com/zio>`__ 三轴云台可通过 MAVLink 协议与飞控通信，兼容多种相机，适用于实时视频或测绘目的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:14
#: f2ba52a573a6435b8a8c5eb47fcbe9d3
msgid ""
"MIO gimbals are unable to communication with ArduPilot.  We hope for a fix "
"with Gremsy software version 7.7.3."
msgstr "MIO 云台无法与 ArduPilot 通信。期待 Gremsy 软件版本 7.7.3 修复此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:16
#: 80f4675e14724375a33abfed14e5e094
msgid "T3V3 gimbals must be running 7.7.3-Preview (or higher)."
msgstr "T3V3 云台必须运行 7.7.3-Preview（或更高版本）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:18
#: 95f5882c33d14c65bfc4a08b0ace3307
msgid ""
"PixyU gimbals must be running 7.7.1 or 7.7.2.  7.7.3 does not work "
"correctly.  We hope for a fix with Gremsy version 7.7.4 (or higher)."
msgstr ""
"PixyU 云台必须运行 7.7.1 或 7.7.2。7.7.3 不能正常工作，期待 Gremsy 版本 7.7.4（或更高版本）修复此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:20
#: 0e8505fa59f94094bc2f1c14f4c8cd04
msgid "PixyWE gimbals are not supported."
msgstr "PixyWE 云台不受支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:22
#: 39d910d2fadd4cfab2b9c7c9511c7ca8
msgid ""
"ZIO gimbals cannot be used as a secondary mount (e.g. \"Connecting Two "
"Gimbals\" below does not work with the ZIO)"
msgstr "ZIO 云台不能用作辅助挂载（例如，下方「连接两个云台」部分不适用于 ZIO）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:25
#: 0849155a27f246a68c9ea6c980e2da65
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:27
#: f266dbb8abb34d8c974953bcc39de3f2
msgid ""
"These gimbals can be purchased from the `Gremsy store "
"<https://gremsy.com/online-store>`__"
msgstr "这些云台可从 `Gremsy 商店 <https://gremsy.com/online-store>`__ 购买"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:30
#: 81bac6d337cb4cd3aeebb60627144115
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:36
#: e246e935d0034921b35041d6440333fe
msgid ""
"Connect the gimbals's COM2 port to one of the autopilot's Serial/Telemetry "
"ports like Telem2 as shown above."
msgstr "将云台的 COM2 口连接到飞控的串口/数传口（如上图所示的 Telem2）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:38
#: 1208e1f378fa46ac82fa513994dc81e1
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot with a ground station and set the following "
"parameters, if using the first mount:"
msgstr "使用地面站连接到飞控，并设置以下参数（使用第一个挂载时）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:40
#: 0a32aa565333454b94ee73ba3863657b
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` to \"6\" for \"Gremsy\" and reboot the autopilot"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` 设置为「6」（Gremsy），然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:41
#: d8228112ee4d4af69dae7bb028e910a2
msgid ""
"If using a ZIO with ArduPilot-4.5.0 (or higher) set :ref:`CAM1_TYPE "
"<CAM1_TYPE>` to \"6\" (MAVLinkCamV2) and reboot the autopilot"
msgstr ""
"若使用 ZIO 搭配 ArduPilot-4.5.0（或更高版本），将 :ref:`CAM1_TYPE <CAM1_TYPE>` "
"设置为「6」（MAVLinkCamV2）并重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:42
#: 408d3c9d502345cb9dfc0c859d6e31a7
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` to \"115\" for 115200 bps.  \"SERIAL2\" "
"can be replaced with another serial port (i.e. SERIAL1) depending upon the "
"physical connection"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` 设置为「115」（115200 "
"bps）。「SERIAL2」可根据实际连接替换为其他串口（如 SERIAL1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:43
#: c0323d5158d647398a0d19eeea721b12
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` to 2 for \"MAVLink2\""
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 设置为 2（MAVLink2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:44
#: 13659fca364c4c39bafe8a34fae71ae2
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS <SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to 1024 for \"Don't forward mavlink"
" to/from\""
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS <SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 1024（「不转发 MAVLink 至/自」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:46
#: 3c4dc41249a34ac58ba7c06a4da2048e
msgid ""
"See the \"Control with an RC transmitter\" section of :ref:`this page "
"<common-mount-targeting>` for details on parameter changes required to "
"control the gimbal through an RC Transmitter (aka \"RC Targeting\")"
msgstr ""
"有关通过 RC 遥控器控制云台所需的参数设置详情，请参阅 :ref:`此页面 <common-mount-targeting>` 的「使用 RC "
"遥控器控制」部分"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:48
#: ca30f9b4aee44b41af5a5f5d354a1827
msgid ""
"When the autopilot has successfully connected to the gimbal, \"Mount: GREMSY"
" PixyU fw:7.7.1.0\" (or similar) will be sent to the ground station.  "
"Looking for this message may be useful in determining if the autopilot and "
"gimbal are communicating successfully."
msgstr ""
"当飞控成功连接到云台后，会向地面站发送「Mount: GREMSY PixyU "
"fw:7.7.1.0」（或类似信息）。查找此消息有助于判断飞控与云台是否通信成功。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:51
#: 794f1bb416bb44cca37843297015cceb
msgid "Configuring the Gimbal"
msgstr "配置云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:53
#: 22e87b92dfa148fcaed61346253b3960
msgid ""
"Download and install `gTune Desktop "
"<https://github.com/Gremsy/gTuneDesktop/releases>`__"
msgstr ""
"下载并安装 `gTune Desktop <https://github.com/Gremsy/gTuneDesktop/releases>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:54
#: 809e45cebfb54a059fbfd47169f8fe60
msgid ""
"Connect the gimbal to your Desktop PC using a USB cable and power on the "
"gimbal"
msgstr "使用 USB 线将云台连接到台式机，并为云台上电"

