#: e6da7b035d1d4b49aa88121f3f927173
msgid "Select \"INFO\" and confirm the gimbal is running Firmware \"7.7.1\" or higher"
msgstr "选择「INFO」，确认云台固件为「7.7.1」或更高版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:65
#: de56159dbb2d4a9bbe6ad4117e36419c
msgid ""
"If the gimbal firmware is older than 7.7.1 download the latest .hex for `Mio"
" <https://github.com/Gremsy/Mio-Firmware/releases>`__,  `Pixy F "
"<https://github.com/Gremsy/PixyF-Firmware/releases>`__, `Pixy U "
"<https://github.com/Gremsy/PixyU-Firmware/releases>`__,  `Pixy WP "
"<https://github.com/Gremsy/PixyW-Firmware/releases>`__,  `S1 "
"<https://github.com/Gremsy/S1V3-Firmware/releases>`__, `T3 "
"<https://github.com/Gremsy/T3V3-Firmware/releases>`__, `T7 "
"<https://github.com/Gremsy/T7-Firmware/releases>`__ or `ZIO "
"<https://github.com/Gremsy/Zio-Firmware/releases>`__"
msgstr ""
"如果云台固件版本低于 7.7.1，请下载以下设备的最新 .hex 固件：`Mio <https://github.com/Gremsy/Mio-"
"Firmware/releases>`__、`Pixy F <https://github.com/Gremsy/PixyF-"
"Firmware/releases>`__、`Pixy U <https://github.com/Gremsy/PixyU-"
"Firmware/releases>`__、`Pixy WP <https://github.com/Gremsy/PixyW-"
