#: ebff586fd47b4746b44823cea47b0f5d
msgid ""
"Select \"SETTINGS\", \"CONTROLS\" and ensure \"SYNC\" is selected so the "
"gimbal communicates with the autopilot using MAVLink"
msgstr "选择「SETTINGS」>「CONTROLS」，确保选中「SYNC」以使云台通过 MAVLink 与飞控通信"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:81
#: ad75fe330af54280b10c197dae773c03
msgid "Select \"Settings\", \"REDUCE DIRFT by DRONE\""
msgstr "选择「Settings」>「REDUCE DIRFT by DRONE」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:87
#: 630cb95b9282418aa36166bcca600667
msgid ""
"Select the \"STIFFNESS\" tab and adjust the Tilt, Roll, and Pan gains so "
"that the gimbal holds the camera in position without shaking"
msgstr "选择「STIFFNESS」选项卡，调整 Tilt、Roll 和 Pan 增益，使云台能稳定保持相机位置而不抖动"

