#: 82d683ed494049d88f814f5811496947
msgid ""
"If two Gremsy gimbals are used, each gimbal can be directly connected to one"
" of the autopilot's serial ports or they can can be daisy-chained together "
"with only one connected to one of the autopilot's serial ports."
msgstr "如果使用两个 Gremsy 云台，每个云台可以直接连接到飞控的一个串口，也可以菊花链方式连接，只有一个连接到飞控串口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:99
#: 389424bc43bc4f32960c25985ff6e807
msgid ""
"Use the gTune desktop application set the second gimbal's MAVLink component "
"id to \"GIMBAL_COMPID2\""
msgstr "使用 gTune 桌面应用程序将第二个云台的 MAVLink 组件 ID 设置为「GIMBAL_COMPID2」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:105
#: 14ad415948084556b53d005609060449
msgid "Connect a GCS to your autopilot and set"
msgstr "连接地面站到飞控并设置"

