#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:111
#: 2a52e9379fc04dbfa4ceaf2d2ca462c9
msgid "Pilot Control"
msgstr "飞手控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:112
#: 9caa325dbe8d4a25a4696d5e91af2095
msgid ""
"To control the gimbal's lean angles from a transmitter set the RC controls "
"for roll, pitch, or yaw using ``RCx_OPTION`` 212 (Mount1 Roll), 213 (Mount1 "
"Pitch), 214 (Mount1 Yaw) for the first mount, or 215-217 for the second "
"mount, respectively."
msgstr ""
"要通过遥控器控制云台的倾斜角度，请使用 ``RCx_OPTION`` 212（挂载1横滚）、213（挂载1俯仰）、214（挂载1偏航）设置第一个挂载的 "
"RC 控制，或分别使用 215-217 设置第二个挂载。"

